        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Prepare Assignment Date Rules",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "const currentDateText = String($context.$system.$currentDate || '').slice(0, 10);\n\nfunction parseDateText(value) {\n  const text = String(value || '').slice(0, 10);\n  const match = text.match(/^(\\d{4})-(\\d{2})-(\\d{2})$/);\n  if (!match) {\n    return null;\n  }\n  return new Date(Date.UTC(Number(match[1]), Number(match[2]) - 1, Number(match[3])));\n}\n\nfunction formatDate(date) {\n  return date.toISOString().slice(0, 10);\n}\n\nlet currentDate = parseDateText(currentDateText);\nif (!currentDate) {\n  currentDate = new Date();\n  currentDate = new Date(Date.UTC(currentDate.getUTCFullYear(), currentDate.getUTCMonth(), currentDate.getUTCDate()));\n}\nconst minimumDueDateValue = new Date(currentDate.getTime());\nminimumDueDateValue.setUTCDate(minimumDueDateValue.getUTCDate() + 1);\nconst minimumDueDate = formatDate(minimumDueDateValue);\n\nconst result = {\n  assignmentStartDate: formatDate(currentDate),\n  minimumDueDate: minimumDueDate,\n  validationMessage: 'Assignment due date must be after the assigned on date. Select ' + minimumDueDate + ' or a later date.'\n};\n\nreturn result;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1768278932045"
          },
          "code": "PREPARE_ASSIGNMENT_DATE_RULES",
          "id": "1778225000001",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "layouts": [
                "ORA_LAYOUT_RECORD"
              ],
              "enableActions": false,
              "enableCommunications": false,
              "customNotes": "Instructions\n- Create exactly one editable Record form and nothing else.\n- Context: assignment for learning item “{{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_LEARNING_ITEM_DETAILS.$output.result.learningItemTitle}}”.\n- Form id: \"<<learningItemId>>_assign\", where learningItemId = {{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_LEARNING_ITEM_DETAILS.$output.result.learningItemId}}.\n- Use the same learningItemId to construct stable, unique field ids.\n- This version supports assigning to My Directs only.\n- The recipient field is mandatory and must always be displayed, even though there is only one selectable option.\n- Do not hide, collapse, infer, or omit the recipient field.\n- Minimum allowed assignment due date is {{$context.$nodes.PREPARE_ASSIGNMENT_DATE_RULES.$output.result.minimumDueDate}}.\n- Date validation message is \"{{$context.$nodes.PREPARE_ASSIGNMENT_DATE_RULES.$output.result.validationMessage}}\".\n\nRequired fields\n- Render exactly these 3 fields in this exact order:\n  1. {\n       id: \"<<learningItemId>>_assign_assignmentDueDate\",\n       label: \"Assignment Due Date\",\n       type: \"date\",\n       value: \"{{$context.$nodes.PREPARE_ASSIGNMENT_DATE_RULES.$output.result.minimumDueDate}}\",\n       minDate: \"{{$context.$nodes.PREPARE_ASSIGNMENT_DATE_RULES.$output.result.minimumDueDate}}\",\n       minValue: \"{{$context.$nodes.PREPARE_ASSIGNMENT_DATE_RULES.$output.result.minimumDueDate}}\",\n       minimumDate: \"{{$context.$nodes.PREPARE_ASSIGNMENT_DATE_RULES.$output.result.minimumDueDate}}\"\n     }\n  2. {\n       id: \"<<learningItemId>>_assign_assignmentNotes\",\n       label: \"Notes\",\n       type: \"text\",\n       value: \"\"\n     }\n  3. {\n       id: \"<<learningItemId>>_assign_assignTo\",\n       label: \"Who should receive this assignment?\",\n       type: \"select\",\n       value: \"DIRECTS\",\n       options: [\n         { label: \"My Directs\", value: \"DIRECTS\" }\n       ]\n     }\n\nValidation\n- The Assignment Due Date control must not allow dates before {{$context.$nodes.PREPARE_ASSIGNMENT_DATE_RULES.$output.result.minimumDueDate}}.\n- Today and past dates are invalid.\n- If the UI supports date constraints, apply the minimum date using all provided minimum-date properties.\n\nPresentation hints\n- Title the form: “Assign Learning”.\n- Left-align labels, inputs, and the submit button.\n- Show the third field exactly as a dropdown/select control with the label “Who should receive this assignment?”.\n\nNotes\n- Preserve exact id formatting; ensure all ids include the resolved learningItemId.\n- Keep labels clear and manager-friendly; do not fabricate additional fields or options.\n- Output only the form widget. Do not output prose, explanations, summaries, or validation text."
            }
          },
          "metadata": {
            "modelConfiguration": {
              "modelProperties": {},
              "code": "ORA_LLM_PREMIUM",
              "model": "OPEN_AI_GPT_4_1_MINI",
              "modelName": "GPT-4.1 mini",
              "provider": "CERT_PREMIUM"
