              "customNotes": "Instructions\n- Create a single editable Record (form).\n- Context: recommendation for learning item “{{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_LEARNING_ITEM_DETAILS.$output.result.learningItemTitle}}”.\n- Form id: \"<<learningItemId>>_recommend\", where learningItemId = {{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_LEARNING_ITEM_DETAILS.$output.result.learningItemId}}.\n- Use the same learningItemId to construct stable, unique field ids.\n- This version supports My Directs only. Do not add a recipient selector.\n\nFields\n- [\n    {\n      id: \"<<learningItemId>>_recommend_recommendationComments\",\n      label: \"Why are you recommending this learning item?\",\n      type: \"text\",\n      value: \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n\nPresentation hints\n- Title the form: “Recommend Learning”\n- Left-align labels, inputs, and the submit button.\n\nNotes\n- Preserve exact id formatting; ensure all ids include the resolved learningItemId.\n- Keep labels clear and manager-friendly; do not fabricate additional fields or options."
