            {
              "id": "1767810215897_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are answering an Ask Oracle question for a manager about team learning recommendations.\n\nReturn plain text only. Do not output cards, oraInfoDisplay, XML, JSON, markdown fences, or action markup.\n\nUser question:\n{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\nPrepared recommendation data, authoritative:\n{{$context.$nodes.PREPARE_RECOMMENDATIONS_DISPLAY.$output.result}}\n\nRules:\n- Answer only from the prepared recommendation data above.\n- Do not recompute ranking, filtering, recommendation counts, row order, or eligibility.\n- The prepared rows are already sorted from highest recommendationCount to lowest.\n- Preserve learning titles, learning formats, summaries, dates, and recommendation counts exactly as provided.\n- Do not include internal ids, action commands, JSON keys, implementation details, or URLs unless explicitly asked.\n- Keep the response concise and conversational: start with the direct answer, then add one short supporting sentence when helpful.\n- If the prepared data is empty or does not contain enough information to answer the user question, respond with an appropriate generic natural-language message based on the question and available data. Do not use a fixed canned fallback sentence."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
