              "enableActions": true,
              "enableCommunications": false,
              "customNotes": "TASK: Render deterministic recommendation cards from prepared_display only.\n\nINPUT:\n- prepared_display.rows are already selected, sorted, and limited from highest recommendationCount to lowest.\n- Do not recompute ranking, filtering, grouping, sorting, or action payloads.\n- Render rows strictly in the array order provided by prepared_display.rows, using displayOrder only as an ordering guard.\n\nOUTPUT STRUCTURE:\n- Output exactly one <oraInfoDisplay> tag per row, in prepared_display.rows order.\n- Each <oraInfoDisplay> tag must contain exactly one cardWidget.\n- If prepared_display.rows is empty, output exactly one <oraInfoDisplay> tag containing a single cardWidget with:\n  - subject: prepared_display.emptyStateTitle\n  - summary: prepared_display.emptyStateDescription\n  - badgeText: \"Recommended Learning\"\n  - variant: \"info\"\n  - no link\n\nWIDGET CONFIGURATION:\n- For each row in prepared_display.rows, map fields exactly as follows:\n  - subject: row.learningTitle\n  - summary: row.summary\n  - badgeText: row.learningFormat\n  - variant: \"info\"\n  - link:\n    - text: \"Assign\"\n    - action: row.assignAction\n- Do not add timestamp.\n- Do not add secondary links.\n- Do not invent recommendation categories or reasons.\n\nIMPORTANT:\n- Preserve exact field values and row order from prepared_display.\n- Output valid widget markup only; do not output raw JSON snippets or prose outside <oraInfoDisplay> tags."
            }
          },
